; A concrete preservation experiment. Both sides of this call-by-value step have type base.
; General preservation needs induction over typing derivations plus a substitution lemma; Kurt's
; current first-order rule language cannot state that meta-theorem without encoding derivations.
load lambda

empty ⊢ (λ x x) : (fun base base)
empty ⊢ unit : base
empty ⊢ (app (λ x x) unit) : base

(app (λ x x) unit) ⇝ unit
empty ⊢ unit : base
